<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Privacy Policy - ExploRoaming</title>
        <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/exploRomeLogo.png" type="image/x-icon">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/all.min.css">
        <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            body {
                font-family:
                    -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
                    sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #333;
                max-width: 800px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            .header {
                text-align: center;
                margin-bottom: 3rem;
            }
            h1 {
                color: #a50591;
                font-size: 2.5rem;
                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            }
            h2 {
                color: #222;
                font-size: 1.5rem;
                margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
                padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            }
            ul {
                margin-left: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
            li {
                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            }
            .date {
                color: #666;
                font-style: italic;
            }
            .contact {
                background: #f8f9fa;
                padding: 1.5rem;
                border-radius: 8px;
                margin-top: 2rem;
            }
            .backward-btn {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: start;
            }
            .backward-btn i {
                font-size: 2rem;
                margin-left: 1rem;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="backward-btn">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-backward"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="date">Last updated: December 1, 2025</p>
        </div>

        <p>
            At <strong>ExploRoaming</strong>, we are committed to protecting
            your privacy and personal information when you use our platform.
            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your
            data when you book stays, list properties, or browse our services.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Personal details:</strong> Name, email address, phone
                number, date of birth, profile photo, payment information, and
                government ID (for verification).
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Booking data:</strong> Property details, dates, guest
                count, and communication between hosts and guests.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Usage data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device
                information, pages visited, and search history.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Cookies:</strong> To enhance your experience, remember
                preferences, and analyze usage patterns.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Process bookings and payments between guests and hosts.</li>
            <li>Verify identities and prevent fraud.</li>
            <li>Improve our platform through analytics and personalization.</li>
            <li>
                Send booking confirmations, updates, and promotional emails (you
                can opt out).
            </li>
            <li>Comply with legal requirements like tax reporting.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Between users:</strong> Hosts see guest contact info;
                guests see host details for bookings.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Service providers:</strong> Payment processors, email
                services, and analytics tools (all privacy-compliant).
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Legal authorities:</strong> When required by law or to
                protect our rights.
            </li>
            <li>
                We <strong>never sell</strong> your personal information to
                third parties.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Your Choices and Rights</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Access, update, or delete your information via account settings.
            </li>
            <li>
                Opt out of marketing emails or cookies through browser settings.
            </li>
            <li>
                Request data export or deletion (subject to legal obligations).
            </li>
            <li>
                Right to object to processing in certain cases (GDPR/CCPA
                compliant).
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Security</h2>
        <p>
            We use industry-standard encryption (SSL/TLS), secure servers, and
            access controls to protect your data against unauthorized access,
            loss, or alteration.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            We keep your data only as long as needed for our services, legal
            obligations, or dispute resolution (typically 7 years for financial
            records).
        </p>

        <h2>7. International Transfers</h2>
        <p>
            Data may be processed in different countries. We ensure adequate
            protections through standard contractual clauses.
        </p>

        <div class="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please email us
                at:
                <a href="#"
                    >explorome@gmail.com</a
                >
            </p>
            <p>We will respond within 30 days.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
            <em
                >This policy may be updated. Changes will be posted here with
                the updated date.</em
            >
        </p>
        <script src="/js/modal-login-signup.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
